nmm_chain_v1 — FROZEN GRAPH. Edit workflows/mm_chain_v1.json in the repo and run deploy.py.\n\n9 ref_image slots (null_ref.png, unused ones bypassed by render.py). TWO audio nodes: COND AUDIO (vocal stem → Loop Start + Current Shot, sliced per scene = the lip-sync mechanism) and MUX AUDIO (full master → Assemble only)."],"title":"📥 Inputs","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":1936,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[930,-263],"size":[380,223],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🧠 Models\n\nH3 int8 fl2va UNET → SageAttention → SolAttn → SigmaShift (12/3). The uninstalled MiniMaxH3MemoryEfficientSageAttentionPatch and the bypassed turbo LoRA from tnew were DROPPED: this is the proven 20-step full-step regime (WTTB S1 v4). Never copy settings from mm_clip — different regime."],"title":"🧠 Models","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":1937,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1565,-280],"size":[380,240],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🔌 Chain plan\n\nOnly prompt_prefix / defaults / shots belong in plan_json. run_name, generation_fingerprint, width/height (1536x864, 16:9, fixed 2026-08-24), context 22, encode video, anchor head, audio_mode source_track, base_seed are widgets on the Plan node — set per job by render.py. At context 22 / head every segment after the first delivers length − 22."],"title":"🔌 Chain plan","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":1938,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[4120,-399],"size":[380,359],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🎛️ Sampling\n\neuler / simple; steps and seed per shot come from CURRENT SHOT (plan). Segment saved + checkpointed after every loop; the Review Gate is DISABLED for headless runs. Recovery nodes (amber) are muted — un-mute them and mute the main Assemble to rebuild from checkpoi